{
  "key": "pr-696",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "chore(pin): awf workflows track @main — always-latest policy (kicker fixes live on merge)",
    "description": "Owner directive 2026-10-04: consumers follow awf main instead of immutable SHA pins — fixes (kicker real ticks awf#13, per-SHA concurrency awf#14, teammate defaults awf#12) go live on merge, no re-pin ceremony per consumer.\n\nSecurity trade-off (accepted by owner): a mutable ref executes whatever sits at awf main head. Mitigation: awf main is load-bearing — review-gated pushes only; stub-ref guard tests assert every awf uses: is exactly main (never a stale SHA, never a random ref); the agents submodule gitlink stays an immutable ENGINE pin via factory_ref.\n\nSupersedes the original fd84ab19 re-pin description (pre-directive plan)."
  }
}

